# NTM-IT

An addon for **HBM's Nuclear Tech - Community Edition** (modid `hbm`) for Minecraft 1.12.2.

> The `server` multiblock system (modular core / compute / heat-exchanger columns, the polling
> data-class registry, panel nodes and free-form dispatch) is specified in **`SERVER_PLAN.md`**.


